will mistakenly search for the lcf. Perhaps this is connected to their use =
and mixing up of terms between the lcm and gcf (greatest common factor).</p=
>
          <p>Think about it for a moment. What is the lcf of any set of num=
bers? Since the lowest factor of any number is 1 then the lowest common fac=
tor of any set of numbers will also be 1.</p>
          -->
